<hr />
<h2>Step 4: Invoice Acquisition &amp; Verification</h2>
<p><strong>Objective</strong>: Ensure every spend has a corresponding compliant invoice to mitigate tax risks.</p>
<p><strong>Actions</strong>:</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Confirm Invoice Types</strong></li>
<li><strong>Meta</strong>: Supports advertising service fee invoices; submit application via backend</li>
<li><strong>TikTok</strong>: Invoices issued with billing cycle; downloadable from 「Billing」→「Invoice Management」</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Google Ads</strong>: Request invoices through Google Cloud Console</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Invoice Application Timeline</strong></p>
</li>
<li>Billing cycles typically run from the 26th of the previous month to the 25th of the current month</li>
<li>Invoices are generally issued 5-7 business days after the billing cycle ends</li>
<li>
<p>Recommend checking for previous month's invoices on the 1st of each month</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Invoice Verification Checklist</strong></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>[ ] Invoice amount matches the platform report's spend amount</p>
</li>
<li>[ ] Invoice header and tax ID information are accurate</li>
<li>[ ] Invoice seal matches the platform entity (e.g., Meta's 「Meta Technologies, Inc.」)</li>
<li>
<p>[ ] Invoice code and number are verifiable in the national tax system</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Exception Handling</strong></p>
</li>
<li>Invoice amount doesn't match report: Submit a platform ticket for investigation</li>
<li>Invoice delayed: Check email spam or contact agency for follow-up</li>
<li>Invoice information errors: Apply for reissuance promptly</li>
</ol>
<hr />
<h2>Step 5: Monthly Unified Reconciliation</h2>
<p><strong>Objective</strong>: Complete full-cycle reconciliation on a fixed monthly schedule with closed-loop financial records.</p>
<p><strong>Actions</strong>:</p>
<p><strong>Step 1: Export Complete Data</strong><br />
- Export all platform ad spend reports for the month<br />
- Export all top-up records for the month<br />
- Compile all received invoices for the month</p>
<p><strong>Step 2: Data Comparison</strong><br />
- Reconciliation formula: <code>Ending Balance = Beginning Balance + Monthly Top-ups - Monthly Spend</code><br />
- If the balance doesn't reconcile, investigate uncredited top-ups, abnormal spend data, or invoice amount discrepancies one by one</p>
<p><strong>Step 3: Generate Reconciliation Report</strong></p>
